<title>PERU: Southern Peru sets dividend.</title>
<headline>Southern Peru sets dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's largest miner Southern Peru Copper Corp said Wednesday it had set a quarterly dividend of $0.35 per ordinary share.</p>
<p>The record date is May 16 and payment will be made June 2, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Southern is 54.1 pct owned by ASARCO Inc and 13.9 percent owned by Phelps Dodge Corp.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
